# config/flatpaks-system.list — system-wide Flatpaks (shared OS feel, needs sudo)
# FORMAT: <remote> <app-id> [branch]. Add -> install system-wide, remove -> prune removes.
# Put here: media, Blender, OBS — apps every user on the machine should have.
# NOTE: NO Firefox (Helium is the only browser, via AUR helium-browser-bin).
# Upstream refuses Flatpak (Chromium sandbox); no flatpak exists.
flathub org.blender.Blender stable
flathub com.obsproject.Studio stable
